message: "If you use this project in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "piper-dual-arm-act-towel-folding"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end imitation learning system for real-time bimanual towel
  folding using the Action Chunking Transformer (ACT), three RGB cameras,
  and dual AgileX Piper manipulators at 30 Hz.
keywords:
  - imitation learning
  - action chunking transformer
  - bimanual manipulation
  - deformable object manipulation
  - robot learning
  - lerobot
license: Apache-2.0
